# Obsidian OS — Ghost (Privacy-Max) flavor additions.
#
# Applied on top of common.pkgs. Ghost is the amnesic/anti-forensic profile:
# volatile logs, Tor by default, MAC randomization, memory wipe on shutdown.
#
# NOTE: this list is trixie-main only. Tor pluggable transports that live
# outside main (snowflake, meek) are staged at runtime by
# scripts/obsidian-tor-runtime, not baked into the ISO.
tor
torsocks
obfs4proxy
macchanger
gnupg
